!Name: p90forwrake-3
!C A period 90 c/3 forwards rake.
!C The exhaust from a period 45 puffer is perturbed by several edge-spark
!C spaceships to eventually form just a forwards glider and a pair of blocks.
!C The glider is reflected by a p15 spaceship so as to react with the blocks.
!C That reaction is perturbed to finally produce the final glider.  This
!C puffer is an improvement on the original period 90 puffer.
!C David I. Bell, July 1997
!Source: jslife-moving
!
